# Claude delivery scratch -- apply_*.py / *.patch files Claude sends for
# review before applying a fix. Save them under this folder (anywhere
# under it, any filename) instead of the repo root, so a plain
# `git add -A` never picks them up again regardless of what they're
# named.
_claude_patches/
